 "text": "Hi, how have you been? It depends on how adventurous you are. A nice cafe is safe and gets you talking over food, but it' not incredibly special. Probably in the shop where you bought it, hidden away. Now worth few quid for an old bike? Not really, a basic service is few quid and that's the kind of thing you do after one night it leaks. Stick to simple ones you both like. Pasta, burgers, fries, they' all easy and you don't end up at each other's throats by the third one. Lots of cafes stay open during a shower, and there's usually always a cafe near a park. If it' pouring by mid after, call it and come back another day.",
